<HelloFraandsPage title="Women-only space" summary="Mahilaon ki zindagi par baat karne ke liye ek surakshit jagah." review={false} related={[]}>
<h2>Who can enter</h2>
<p>This space is available to callers and hosts whose verified KYC gender field is F or T. Both sides must meet this requirement. All users must be 18 or older.</p>
<h2>What the space is for</h2>
<p>Talk and share about women's lives, everyday experiences, and interests. Hosts offer conversation and company. They do not provide medical advice or counselling.</p>
<h2>Privacy and conduct</h2>
<p>The space and its member content are hidden from other accounts. This public page explains eligibility only. Do not share another person's identity or anything they tell you.</p>
<p>The same <a href="/community-guidelines">community guidelines</a> and <a href="/recording-policy">recording rules</a> apply. Sexual talk, harassment, requests for contact details, and requests to meet are not allowed.</p>
<h2>Report a concern</h2>
<p>End the call if you feel uncomfortable. Use the report option in your call history, or visit <a href="/report">Report a user</a>. Include the call ID and say that the call happened in the women-only space.</p>
</HelloFraandsPage>
